{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows经DNS伪造SPN疑似Kerberos强制认证。对应需求：凭据访问。官方：Potential Kerberos Coercion via DNS-Based SPN Spoofing。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-system.security*","logs-windows.forwarded*","winlogbeat-*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows经DNS伪造SPN疑似Kerberos强制认证","references":["https://www.synacktiv.com/en/publications/ntlm-reflection-is-dead-long-live-ntlm-reflection-an-in-depth-analysis-of-cve-2025.html","https://blog.redteam-pentesting.de/2025/reflective-kerberos-relay-attack/","https://googleprojectzero.blogspot.com/2021/10/using-kerberos-for-authentication-relay.html","https://github.com/CICADA8-Research/RemoteKrbRelay/blob/main/README.md","https://github.com/Orange-Cyberdefense/ocd-mindmaps/blob/main/excalimap/mindmap/ad/authenticated.md"],"risk_score":73,"rule_id":"f701be14-0a36-4e9a-a851-b3e20ae55f09","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 凭据访问","来源: 默认","对应需求: 凭据访问"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"query","query":"host.os.type:\"windows\" and\n(\n  (event.code:4662 and winlog.event_data.AdditionalInfo: *UWhRC*BAAAA*MicrosoftDNS*) or \n  (event.code:5137 and winlog.event_data.ObjectDN: *UWhRC*BAAAA*MicrosoftDNS*)\n)\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows经DNS伪造SPN疑似Kerberos强制认证\n\n### 为何重要\n窃取或中继域与本机凭据\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程、用户与事件ID。\n2. 核对路径、注册表、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与凭据操作。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件与账号。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","winlog.event_data.TargetUserName","message"]},"threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1557","name":"Adversary-in-the-Middle","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1557/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1557.001","name":"LLMNR/NBT-NS Poisoning and SMB Relay","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1557/001/"}]},{"id":"T1187","name":"Forced Authentication","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1187/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0006","name":"Credential Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0006/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"system","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"}],"version":5,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
